msgid "nagmon_owl_intro_story"
msgstr ""
"Wise Owl: Hello, ${{name}}! I'm glad you came.\n"
"A grey fog fell on our world. It is called the Fog of Forgetting.\n"
"Whoever it touches forgets: numbers, words, shapes.\n"
"Even the monsters forgot their powers, and the world is losing its colors.\n"
"But there is a way to bring it all back: knowledge! Everything we learn gives power back."

msgid "nagmon_owl_intro_power"
msgstr ""
"This is called knowledge power. Here is how it works:\n"
"In a duel you can answer a question before a move. A right answer makes the move stronger!\n"
"You can always attack without a question too.\n"
"And a mistake? That's fine. The move is a normal one, and I will explain."

msgid "nagmon_owl_intro_starter"
msgstr ""
"Three little monsters are waiting for a friend.\n"
"Heliobud is a sun monster. It loves math.\n"
"Terrabub is an earth monster. It loves shapes.\n"
"Lunibble is a moon monster. It loves science.\n"
"Who will be your first friend?"

msgid "nagmon_owl_picked_heliobud"
msgstr ""
"Heliobud jumps for joy!\n"
"When it attacks, the questions will be about math."

msgid "nagmon_owl_picked_terrabub"
msgstr ""
"Terrabub hums quietly.\n"
"When it attacks, the questions will be about shapes."

msgid "nagmon_owl_picked_lunibble"
msgstr ""
"Lunibble glows a little with joy.\n"
"When it attacks, the questions will be about science."

msgid "nagmon_owl_gifts"
msgstr ""
"Here are 5 capture balls and 3 potions.\n"
"Monsters live in the tall grass on Route 1. You can make friends with them."

msgid "nagmon_owl_first_q"
msgstr ""
"Let's try one question together.\n"
"No clock and no rush. Take your time."

msgid "nagmon_owl_first_good"
msgstr ""
"Very nice! You thought it all the way through.\n"
"That's how knowledge power charges up."

msgid "nagmon_owl_first_wrong"
msgstr ""
"No problem! Mistakes are part of learning.\n"
"Now we already know something new."

msgid "nagmon_owl_go"
msgstr ""
"The people in town need help, and each of them teaches something.\n"
"Route 1 starts at the north of town.\n"
"The yellow building on the right is the Granite Academy. The master waits there.\n"
"And if your monsters are tired, come to me."

msgid "nagmon_owl_heal"
msgstr ""
"Your monsters rested and drank some water.\n"
"They are full of power again!"

msgid "nagmon_owl_tip_granite"
msgstr ""
"Tip: the master's test has 3 questions about shapes.\n"
"Two right answers are enough. And you can try again as often as you like."

msgid "nagmon_owl_tip_mila"
msgstr ""
"Your Stone Badge is shining!\n"
"Next to the Granite Academy there is another one: Mila, the math academy."

msgid "nagmon_owl_tip_all"
msgstr ""
"Two badges! Steady, beautiful work.\n"
"The fog has moved back a little from the town. The adventure is only beginning."

msgid "nagmon_owl_congrats_granite"
msgstr ""
"Wise Owl: I saw what happened at the academy!\n"
"You answered questions about shapes and kept going in the duel.\n"
"Look, the color is coming back to the town. That's your knowledge!"

msgid "nagmon_owl_cape"
msgstr ""
"Wise Owl: And look what I got, a blue cape for your badge!\n"
"I will wear it proudly. We took this step together."

msgid "nagmon_owl_congrats_mila"
msgstr ""
"Wise Owl: Another badge! You practised math until it worked.\n"
"The fog moved back a little more."

msgid "nagmon_world_cashier_hello"
msgstr ""
"Avi: Hello! I'm counting the money in the till.\n"
"Can you help me with a little sum?"

msgid "nagmon_world_cashier_good"
msgstr ""
"Exactly! You counted right, and the till is in order.\n"
"Thank you! Here are 20 coins for your help."

msgid "nagmon_world_cashier_free"
msgstr ""
"Exactly! You counted right.\n"
"You already helped me a lot today. Thank you!"

msgid "nagmon_world_cashier_wrong"
msgstr ""
"Almost! With money it helps to count slowly, coin after coin.\n"
"You can try again whenever you like."

msgid "nagmon_world_tourist_hello"
msgstr ""
"Hello! I am Tom. I am a tourist.\n"
"(Tom is visiting. He speaks English.)\n"
"Let's help him with some English!"

msgid "nagmon_world_tourist_good"
msgstr ""
"Thank you very much!\n"
"You helped Tom understand. Tom gives you a potion."

msgid "nagmon_world_tourist_free"
msgstr ""
"Thank you! See you!\n"
"Tom is happy to practise with you."

msgid "nagmon_world_tourist_wrong"
msgstr ""
"Good try!\n"
"Now we saw the answer. Next time it will be easier."

msgid "nagmon_world_gardener_hello"
msgstr ""
"Michal: Hello! My garden is full of questions.\n"
"Can you help me with a science question?"

msgid "nagmon_world_gardener_good"
msgstr ""
"Right! You looked closely at the world.\n"
"Here is a wood berry from the garden, for you."

msgid "nagmon_world_gardener_free"
msgstr ""
"Right! Learning together is fun.\n"
"The garden is blooming today."

msgid "nagmon_world_gardener_wrong"
msgstr ""
"No problem! Scientists make mistakes too, and then they learn.\n"
"Come back whenever you like."

msgid "nagmon_world_kid_lost"
msgstr ""
"Yoav: Oh no... my kitten, Pitzi, ran away!\n"
"She ran north to Route 1, past the tall grass.\n"
"Can you help me find her?"

msgid "nagmon_world_kid_waiting"
msgstr ""
"Yoav: Pitzi ran to Route 1.\n"
"She is on the left side, past the tall grass."

msgid "nagmon_world_kitten_found"
msgstr ""
"Meow! Pitzi purrs.\n"
"She jumps into your arms. Now you can bring her back to Yoav."

msgid "nagmon_world_kid_thanks"
msgstr ""
"Yoav: Pitzi! You found her! Thank you so much!\n"
"You went all the way to Route 1 for a friend. That is real kindness."

msgid "nagmon_world_kid_reward"
msgstr "Yoav gives you 2 potions and 30 coins."

msgid "nagmon_world_kid_happy"
msgstr ""
"Yoav: Pitzi and I play all day.\n"
"Thanks for helping!"

msgid "nagmon_world_kitten_purr"
msgstr "Pitzi: Meow! Purrrr..."

msgid "nagmon_world_wallet_found"
msgstr ""
"You found a wallet on the sidewalk!\n"
"There is a note inside: \"Grandma Rina's\".\n"
"What do we do with the wallet?"

msgid "nagmon_world_wallet_return"
msgstr ""
"The wallet is in the bag, on its way to Grandma Rina.\n"
"She lives on the east side of the street."

msgid "nagmon_world_wallet_kept"
msgstr ""
"The wallet is in the bag.\n"
"Hmm... maybe someone is looking for it right now."

msgid "nagmon_world_granny_hello"
msgstr ""
"Grandma Rina: Hello, ${{name}}!\n"
"What a lovely day for a walk in town."

msgid "nagmon_world_granny_thanks"
msgstr ""
"Grandma Rina: My wallet! I looked for it all morning.\n"
"You brought it back, even when nobody was watching. That is honesty."

msgid "nagmon_world_granny_reward"
msgstr "Grandma Rina gives you 30 coins and a water berry from her garden."

msgid "nagmon_world_granny_value"
msgstr ""
"Honesty helps everyone feel safe.\n"
"Thank you so much!"

msgid "nagmon_world_granny_lost"
msgstr ""
"Grandma Rina: Oh, I lost my wallet.\n"
"It has a photo of my grandchildren..."

msgid "nagmon_world_granny_later"
msgstr "Grandma Rina: All right. If the wallet turns up, I'll be very happy."

msgid "nagmon_world_granny_happy"
msgstr ""
"Grandma Rina: Thanks again for the wallet.\n"
"My grandchildren say hello!"

# --- the insides of the houses of Hearthrock ---

msgid "nagmon_house_pet"
msgstr "The little friend"

msgid "nagmon_house_nurse"
msgstr "Nurse Dana"

msgid "nagmon_house_shopkeeper"
msgstr "Avi the shopkeeper"

msgid "nagmon_house_tutor"
msgstr "The tutor"

msgid "nagmon_house_neighbor"
msgstr "The neighbour"

msgid "nagmon_world_home_pet"
msgstr "Purr! Your little friend is happy you are home."

msgid "nagmon_world_rest_nurse"
msgstr ""
"Nurse Dana: Welcome to the Rest Center!\n"
"You can rest here any time."

msgid "nagmon_world_shop_keeper"
msgstr ""
"Avi: Welcome to the shop!\n"
"Look around, the shelves will be full soon."

msgid "nagmon_world_lab_tutor"
msgstr ""
"Tutor: Welcome to the learning room!\n"
"Soon there will be questions and tips here."

msgid "nagmon_world_friend_neighbor"
msgstr ""
"Neighbour: Hello, and welcome to my house!\n"
"Come again soon."

msgid "nagmon_world_trainer_hello"
msgstr ""
"Danny: Hi! I deliver letters, and I train on my break.\n"
"Want a friendly duel? Just for fun."

msgid "nagmon_world_trainer_later"
msgstr "Danny: Sure. I'm here all day."

msgid "nagmon_world_trainer_won"
msgstr ""
"Danny: What a nice duel!\n"
"My monsters got tired, but they had lots of fun."

msgid "nagmon_world_trainer_lost"
msgstr ""
"Danny: That was a good duel!\n"
"Your monsters rested a little. We can duel again whenever you like."

msgid "nagmon_world_trainer_done"
msgstr ""
"Danny: A tip from a mail carrier: a question before a move = a strong move.\n"
"Good luck at the academy!"

msgid "nagmon_world_sign_tree"
msgstr ""
"Sign: TREE = a tree\n"
"A tree gives shade, fruit and a home for birds.\n"
"TREE. Now this word is yours!"

msgid "nagmon_world_master_next"
msgstr "Nice. Second question!"

msgid "nagmon_world_master_last"
msgstr "And now the last question."

msgid "nagmon_world_granite_hello"
msgstr ""
"Master Granite: Welcome to the Granite Academy!\n"
"Here we learn shapes: triangles, squares, circles and more."

msgid "nagmon_world_granite_rules"
msgstr ""
"Before a friendly duel there is a little test: 3 questions.\n"
"Two right answers are enough. There is no clock. Let's begin!"

msgid "nagmon_world_granite_pass"
msgstr ""
"You passed the test! I can see you practised.\n"
"Now, a friendly duel. Good luck!"

msgid "nagmon_world_granite_not_yet"
msgstr ""
"Master Granite: It didn't work out this time, and that's fine.\n"
"A mountain is built stone by stone. You can practise with the people in town.\n"
"Come back and try again whenever you like."

msgid "nagmon_world_granite_rematch"
msgstr ""
"Master Granite: You're back! The test is already behind you.\n"
"Let's go on to a friendly duel."

msgid "nagmon_world_granite_won"
msgstr ""
"Master Granite: An excellent duel!\n"
"You thought about every step, like someone building a stone house."

msgid "nagmon_world_granite_badge"
msgstr "You got the Stone Badge and 100 coins!"

msgid "nagmon_world_granite_lost"
msgstr ""
"Master Granite: That was a good duel.\n"
"Your monsters rested a little. You can try again whenever you like."

msgid "nagmon_world_granite_done"
msgstr ""
"Master Granite: The Stone Badge shines nicely.\n"
"Shapes are everywhere. Try looking for them!"

msgid "nagmon_world_mila_hello"
msgstr ""
"Master Mila: Welcome to the Mila Academy!\n"
"Here we practise math: adding, taking away and more."

msgid "nagmon_world_mila_rules"
msgstr ""
"Before a friendly duel there is a little test: 3 math questions.\n"
"Two right answers are enough. There is no clock. Let's begin!"

msgid "nagmon_world_mila_pass"
msgstr ""
"You passed the test! You worked it out patiently.\n"
"Now, a friendly duel. Good luck!"

msgid "nagmon_world_mila_not_yet"
msgstr ""
"Master Mila: It didn't work out this time, and that's fine.\n"
"Every number we practise gets easier.\n"
"Come back and try again whenever you like."

msgid "nagmon_world_mila_rematch"
msgstr ""
"Master Mila: You're back! The test is already behind you.\n"
"Let's go on to a friendly duel."

msgid "nagmon_world_mila_won"
msgstr ""
"Master Mila: An excellent duel!\n"
"Every step was well thought out."

msgid "nagmon_world_mila_badge"
msgstr "You got the Number Badge and 100 coins!"

msgid "nagmon_world_mila_lost"
msgstr ""
"Master Mila: That was a good duel.\n"
"Your monsters rested a little. You can try again whenever you like."

msgid "nagmon_world_mila_done"
msgstr ""
"Master Mila: The Number Badge is shining!\n"
"Numbers hide everywhere: in the shop, on the clock, on the road."

msgid "nagmon_restore_failed"
msgstr "This player can't come back right now: another player has the same name, or there are already 8 players."

msgid "nagmon_too_many_players"
msgstr "There are already 8 players. Delete one in the parent area to add a new one."

msgid "nagmon_parent_github"
msgstr "Send data to the developer (GitHub)"

msgid "nagmon_github_ok"
msgstr "Connected · private data repo {repo}"

msgid "nagmon_github_public"
msgstr "The data repo {repo} is public, so nothing is sent. On GitHub open the repo's Settings, choose Private under Change visibility, and try again."

msgid "nagmon_github_bad_token"
msgstr "The token is wrong or has expired. Create a new token on GitHub and paste it again."

msgid "nagmon_github_no_permission"
msgstr "The token has no Contents: Read and write permission for {repo}. Add it in the token's settings on GitHub and try again."

msgid "nagmon_github_not_found"
msgstr "The data repo {repo} was not found, or the token may not use it. Choose this repo in the token's settings on GitHub and try again."

msgid "nagmon_github_offline"
msgstr "No internet. Connect to a network and try again."

msgid "nagmon_github_timeout"
msgstr "GitHub did not answer in time. Check the internet and try again."

msgid "nagmon_github_conflict"
msgstr "GitHub was busy and did not save the file. Try again in a minute."

msgid "nagmon_github_failed"
msgstr "GitHub did not accept the request. Try again later."

msgid "nagmon_github_not_connected"
msgstr "Not connected. Sending needs a GitHub token for the data repo. Tap Connect: paste token."

msgid "nagmon_github_checking"
msgstr "Checking the connection to GitHub..."

msgid "nagmon_github_sending"
msgstr "Sending..."

msgid "nagmon_github_connect"
msgstr "Connect: paste token"

msgid "nagmon_github_send_log"
msgstr "Send the log"

msgid "nagmon_github_send_progress"
msgstr "Send progress"

msgid "nagmon_github_send_crash"
msgstr "Send the last crash report"

msgid "nagmon_github_disconnect"
msgstr "Disconnect"

msgid "nagmon_github_disconnected"
msgstr "Disconnected. The token was deleted from this device."

msgid "nagmon_github_clipboard_empty"
msgstr "The clipboard is empty. On GitHub create a fine-grained token for the data repo only, with one permission: Contents: Read and write. Copy it, come back here and tap again."

msgid "nagmon_github_clipboard_not_token"
msgstr "The clipboard holds something that is not a GitHub token. Copy the token (it starts with github_pat_) and try again."

msgid "nagmon_github_confirm_log"
msgstr "To be sent: the game's log, without keys, to the private data repo {repo}."

msgid "nagmon_github_confirm_progress"
msgstr "To be sent: progress of {count} children, without names, to the private data repo {repo}."

msgid "nagmon_github_confirm_crash"
msgstr "To be sent: the last crash report, without keys, to the private data repo {repo}."

msgid "nagmon_github_send"
msgstr "Send"

msgid "nagmon_github_cancel"
msgstr "Cancel"

msgid "nagmon_github_sent"
msgstr "Sent."

msgid "nagmon_github_log_empty"
msgstr "There is no log to send yet."

msgid "nagmon_github_confirm_progress_one"
msgstr "To be sent: progress of one child, without the name, to the private data repo {repo}."

